    "reflection_output_limit": 4,
    "activation_rule": "Structured executable gates only; exact base and upgraded card observations share a family retrieval identity while variant effects remain lossless evidence; every executable state gate must occur in trajectory evidence; applicable_when is audit-only and cannot introduce a hidden hard prerequisite; card_value still requires eligible support from two distinct full runs",
